{"2895410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monsterest", "steam_appid": 2895410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/03c01ff20817cfea23341c62a7c27d08.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1293 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to share feedback and report bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/b5f16cef0f00a08d23fbdb853f81c9a0.avif?t=1787108530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras_big/b5f16cef0f00a08d23fbdb853f81c9a0.webp?t=1787108530 width=1560 height=355 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build an Inn That Feels Like Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of inn will you create? Build walls, apply wallpaper, and decorate every room to your liking. Don't like the color of your furniture? Dye it into something that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Strange and Adorable Monster Guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New monster guests arrive every day. Who will visit your inn today? Prepare rooms and meals, then assign each guest to the perfect room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt, Fish, and More with Monster Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become friends with your guests. As your friendship grows, they'll join you for hunting, fishing, woodcutting, and other activities while helping you run the inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/97342bfd3c10441a6672eb2bb3e1f5de.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/97342bfd3c10441a6672eb2bb3e1f5de.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/97342bfd3c10441a6672eb2bb3e1f5de.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your guests happy and raise your Stay Rating. As your inn grows, new guests will arrive and even more furniture recipes will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/e2ffae77a351d61c2a42d6734d281017.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/e2ffae77a351d61c2a42d6734d281017.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/e2ffae77a351d61c2a42d6734d281017.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dress Up Your Monster Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your friend wearing something a little too unusual? Gift them outfits you've picked out yourself. You can also surprise them with upgraded tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c38d4e1f56c185bd0d81be07e67a3c2a.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c38d4e1f56c185bd0d81be07e67a3c2a.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c38d4e1f56c185bd0d81be07e67a3c2a.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets of the Monster World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world beyond your inn! There's nothing dangerous out there... probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c52b8e77ae671f1ab1362428b754aaba.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c52b8e77ae671f1ab1362428b754aaba.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/c52b8e77ae671f1ab1362428b754aaba.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange and adorable monster guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fish, and chop wood with your monster friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your dream inn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of furniture pieces and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dye furniture and clothing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure chests to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking and recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A research system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint and Whirlwind Attack abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q. Can I create content, stream, or upload videos of this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A. Yes. We'd really appreciate it if you could include the game's title and Steam page link in your video description or post. You can also download the official game logo for your content from our website. On the Steam page (PC version), you'll find the website link on the right-hand side.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build an Inn That Feels Like Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of inn will you create? Build walls, apply wallpaper, and decorate every room to your liking. Don't like the color of your furniture? Dye it into something that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/90f38b9a9ec1670cd113be87464d2e78.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Strange and Adorable Monster Guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New monster guests arrive every day. Who will visit your inn today? Prepare rooms and meals, then assign each guest to the perfect room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.poster.avif?t=1787108530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.webm?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895410/extras/207820422208af954401c99607b0e956.mp4?t=1787108530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt, Fish, and More with Monster Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become friends with your guests. As your friendship grows, they'll join you for hunting, fishing, woodcutting, and other activities while helping you run the inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea